# Promotions (D-41a / D-42)

- Runtime SoR is in-repo `@dial/promotions` — **not** Medusa or OfferKit services.
- Price effects only via pricing engine calling `computeActions` (or documented entrypoints) — no ad-hoc discount writes in UI/API handlers.
- Promo credit is non-cash; **no cash-out**.
- Supplier co-op (`SUPPLIER_COOP`) needs approval + statement lines; budget/fraud holds in admin.
- Do not introduce a second commerce/money engine “because the donor had payments.”
